      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 8 years 9 months ago",
      "body": "We are looking for creative writers. Full training and ongoing support provided, you will be part of a fun and friendly team of freelancers from around the world. Working times are flexible and you can arrange them differently each week to fit around your life. You will need to demonstrate the ability to follow instructions, multitask and be proactive. You have the freedom to work from anywhere.\nRequirements:\n• Native, at the very least proficient level of English and error free typing\n• Good working laptop/desktop computer (mobile devices are not suitable)\n• Back up internet connection (if travelling or working from out of home)\n• A good sense of humour and a strong drive to succeed\n• A minimum commitment of 15 hours per week\nIf you are interested to find out more please apply now on cloudnomads. net\nWe look forward to hearing from you!",
